# Lekto Project Rules

## Hard Rules (NEVER violate)
1. **Max 150 lines per file** (200 absolute max for complex components)
2. **No shadows** — no shadow-sm, shadow-md, shadow-lg, shadow-xl anywhere
3. **No localStorage** — Supabase only for all data
4. **No "local" fallback** — tutor_id comes from auth.uid(), never hardcoded
5. **No emoji in UI** — Lucide icons or text only
6. **No dark mode** — light theme only
7. **Await all DB writes** — no fire-and-forget
8. **No gradients** — flat design only
9. **Features don't import from each other** — compose at page level

## Style Rules
- Colors: bg #f5f3ee, cards white, border #e8e5de, text #1a1a1a, muted #888, accent #2d5a3d
- Landing: CSS Modules only
- Cabinet: Tailwind v4 + Radix UI (NOT shadcn)
- Font: Georgia serif for headings, Inter for body
- OG images: 1200x630, <600KB, JPG format

## File Organization
- One component per file
- kebab-case filenames
- Split into folder + index.tsx when file > 150 lines
- Shared components in components/, feature-specific in features/*/components/

